{
    "urlOriginal": "https://www.google.com",
    "urlCurta": "google123",
    "ativo": true
}

### atualizar
PATCH http://localhost:3000/links/1
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "urlCurta": "novogoogle",
    "ativo": false
}

### remover
DELETE http://localhost:3000/links/1
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### redirecionar
GET http://localhost:3000/links/redirecionar/google123

